{"ID":"20240118151050-2c1kcad","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151050-2c1kcad","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151050-2c1kcad\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151051-mw0iw9m\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240202102910-2wb0g32\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122142853-7vnemf1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:186,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:186\u0026#125;","title":"249大豆黄卷（豆卷、豆芽）","type":"doc","updated":"20240202102910"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151051-mw0iw9m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151051-mw0iw9m","updated":"20240122142842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味甘，平，无毒。治湿痹，筋挛，膝痛。生大豆。平。涂痈肿，煮汁饮，杀鬼毒。止痛。赤小豆，平。主下水，排痈肿脓血。生平泽。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122142844-khp569y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122142844-khp569y"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】黑大豆所制成，处处有之。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122142846-9fruu1i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122142846-9fruu1i"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味甘，性平，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122142847-s07g6ah","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122142847-s07g6ah"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】大豆黄卷为清热开胃，推陈去积要药，主行水去湿，胃气结积，治湿痹筋挛膝痛。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122142849-5vhyys6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122142849-5vhyys6"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】五脏不足，味气结积，益气止痛，去黑皯，润肌肤皮毛。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122142850-h5v5qwf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122142850-h5v5qwf"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通钱半至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122142852-f10x4e0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122142852-f10x4e0"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】恶海藻龙胆。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122142842-7vyzqxr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122142842-7vyzqxr"}},{"ID":"20240122142852-f6907ow","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122142852-f6907ow"}},{"ID":"20240122142853-7vnemf1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122142853-7vnemf1","updated":"20240202102849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"249，大豆黄卷，我们一般写豆卷，它是黑大豆做的，一般来说这是黑大豆，不是那个黑大头，要更正，黑大豆。味甘性平，它是一般推陈出新，去积的药物，能够开胃，所以一般在肠胃的地方会用得比较多。经方里面，张仲景没有用这个药。那你可以知道，可以开没有关系，那跟张仲景的药比起来，张仲景用肠胃的药，和豆卷不一样，豆卷好像是我们煮面，吃面啊，入味，弄豆卷吃吃啊，那是跟张仲景比起来。"}]},{"ID":"20240122142856-r9pkr10","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122142856-r9pkr10","updated":"20240202102907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"张仲景如果说把经方根温病的药一拿起来，温病的药好像病人刷牙，漱口，洗脸，掏掏耳朵，漱漱眼，洗洗眼睛用，那个塞塞牙缝，经方到身体里面去，完全不一样。它的几味药都是重点。所以，豆卷煮煮菜也可以，没有关系。行水去湿，豆可以滋润的啊。"}]},{"ID":"20240202102910-2wb0g32","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202102910-2wb0g32"}}]}